{
  "title": "논문 슬라이드 예시 — LLaMA 1",
  "subtitle": "구조·조건별 결과 · 3장 예시 / 전체 논문 발표 아님",
  "slides": [
    {
      "title": "정규화의 위치와<br>함수를 따로 봅니다",
      "body": "<p>LLaMA는 각 sublayer의 입력을 정규화하고 RMSNorm을 사용합니다. 원 Transformer의 post-norm과 비교하면 순서가 바뀝니다.</p><p>아래 식은 잔차 경로를 설명하는 축약입니다. pre-norm의 위치 선택과 RMSNorm이라는 함수 선택은 서로 다른 축입니다.</p>",
      "visual": "<div class=\"norm-pair\"><div class=\"diagram-panel\"><div class=\"diagram-title\"><span>원 Transformer</span><strong>Post-norm</strong></div><div class=\"diagram-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Post-norm 잔차 연결도 · 가로로 스크롤 가능\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 630 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"원 Transformer: sublayer와 잔차를 더한 후 LayerNorm\"><defs><marker id=\"post\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z\" fill=\"#5D6570\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M50 80H98\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#post)\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"52\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#959BA5\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"87.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-label\">Sublayer</text><path d=\"M240 80H301\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#post)\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"80\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-label\">+</text><path d=\"M338 80H388\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#post)\"/><rect x=\"390\" y=\"52\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#959BA5\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"460.0\" y=\"87.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-label\">LayerNorm</text><path d=\"M530 80H585\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#post)\"/><path d=\"M62 80V158H320V101\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#post)\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"87\" class=\"sv-label\">x</text><text x=\"595\" y=\"87\" class=\"sv-label\">y</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-note\">잔차 경로</text></svg></div><div class=\"formula\">LayerNorm(x + Sublayer(x))</div></div><div class=\"diagram-panel emphasized\"><div class=\"diagram-title\"><span>LLaMA</span><strong>Pre-norm + RMSNorm</strong></div><div class=\"diagram-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Pre-norm 잔차 연결도 · 가로로 스크롤 가능\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 630 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LLaMA: RMSNorm 이후 sublayer, 입력 잔차를 더함\"><defs><marker id=\"pre\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z\" fill=\"#5D6570\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M50 80H98\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#pre)\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"52\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#EEF2FA\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"87.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-label\">RMSNorm</text><path d=\"M240 80H278\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#pre)\"/><rect x=\"280\" y=\"52\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#EEF2FA\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"87.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-label\">Sublayer</text><path d=\"M420 80H491\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#pre)\"/><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"80\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-label\">+</text><path d=\"M528 80H585\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#pre)\"/><path d=\"M62 80V158H510V101\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5D6570\" stroke-width=\"2\"  marker-end=\"url(#pre)\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"87\" class=\"sv-label\">x</text><text x=\"595\" y=\"87\" class=\"sv-label\">y</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"sv-note\">잔차 경로</text></svg></div><div class=\"formula\">x + Sublayer(RMSNorm(x))</div></div></div><div class=\"annotation blue\"><strong>위치와 함수는 별개의 선택입니다.</strong><span>RMSNorm은 root mean square로 정규화하며 mean-centering을 생략합니다.</span></div>",
      "note": "",
      "section": "2",
      "section_label": "데이터·설계·학습",
      "layout": "process",
